Conflicts: alsa-ucm-conf
Breaks: libretech-alsa-ucm-conf (<< ${binary:Version})
Replaces: alsa-ucm-conf, libretech-alsa-ucm-conf (<< ${binary:Version})
Description: ALSA Use Case Manager configuration (Libre Computer)
 Upstream alsa-ucm-conf with the Libre Computer board profiles on top. It
 replaces Debian's alsa-ucm-conf. The USB-Audio and sof-soundwire profile
 families are held at upstream 1.2.14 so the tree loads on alsa-lib 1.2.14.

Package: libretech-alsa-ucm-conf
Architecture: all
Section: oldlibs
Depends: alsa-ucm-conf-libre-computer (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: transitional package for alsa-ucm-conf-libre-computer
 The Libre Computer ALSA Use Case Manager configuration is now
 alsa-ucm-conf-libre-computer. This package pulls it in and can be removed.
